{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028094819057-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028111715\"/><p>赤柱正灘泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（28日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘、石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；離島區的長洲東灣泳灘及銀礦灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該7處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該7處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:21:16.495691+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:48:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:25.827503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:18:45.614695+00:00","content_hash":"6854af4c6115bf08021a69b93a411ebd2ffb69937070bd87204b379d9590041d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}